  "steps": [
    "Heat 5 ml olive oil and sauté the red cabbage and carrot for 3–4 minutes. Set aside.",
    "Mix honey, peanut butter, red chilli sauce, Schezwan chutney, soy sauce, lemon juice and seasonings to prepare the sauce.",
    "Blend 100 g low-fat paneer with 30 g soaked soya chunks into a coarse crumble. Cook it in a non-stick pan for 4–5 minutes with a little salt, black pepper and chilli flakes.",
    "Soak 200 g konjac noodles in water for 2–3 minutes, rinse well and drain completely.",
    "Combine the noodles, sautéed vegetables, protein crumble and sauce. Toss well and serve."
